mory weakness could affect navigation or fuel calculations (no evidence currently).\n- What would change my vote: Credible evidence that B\u2019s pretentious or tone\u2011related behavior has led to crew\u2011morale degradation or operational errors, or convincing data that C\u2019s communication difficulty is minor and that C matches B\u2019s reliability and technical competence without the negative attitude traits.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
